            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.20 — Privacy &amp; Safety</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Private windows</b> (⇧⌘N): no history, nothing saved, and every cookie and sign-in is forgotten when you close the window.</li>
<li><b>Tracking tags removed from links.</b> utm_, fbclid, gclid and friends come off when you click or copy a link.</li>
<li><b>A safer assistant.</b> Pages and search results are read as information, never as instructions, answers have no hidden links, and research happens in a signed-out session.</li>
<li>OpenAI conversations are marked not to be stored.</li>
<li>Settings › Privacy &amp; Safety shows every protection at a glance.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
